values ('generated-reading-en-a1-845b8f2e8367', 'en', 'A1', 'My Friends and Family', 'Hello! My name is Ana. I am from Brazil. I am a teacher. This is my friend John. He is from the United States. He is a doctor. That is Maria. She is from Portugal. She is a student. We are in São Paulo. We are happy. My friends are very nice.

My family is here too. My parents are Carlos and Beatriz. They are from Rio de Janeiro. They are retired. This is my dog, Bidu. It is small and friendly. My brother Pedro is a chef. He is very tall. My sister Carla is a nurse. She is short. We are all together today. My family is big and fun.

You are my new friend. You are welcome here! Are you excited? I am excited. Today is a special day for us. We have a party. The party is for the family. Everything is ready. We are ready!', '[{"answer_index":1,"explanation_pt_br":"No texto, John é médico: \"He is a doctor.\"","options":["He is a teacher","He is a doctor","He is a chef","He is a nurse"],"prompt":"Who is John?"},{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"Carla é enfermeira: \"My sister Carla is a nurse.\"","options":["She is a nurse","She is a student","She is a doctor","She is a chef"],"prompt":"Who is Carla?"},{"answer_index":2,"explanation_pt_br":"A festa está acontecendo: \"We have a party. The party is for the family.\"","options":["They are working","They are happy","They are having a party","They are traveling"],"prompt":"What are they doing today?"}]'::jsonb, 0, true)
