values ('generated-reading-en-a1-2b41e01a20c7', 'en', 'A1', 'Our New Friends', 'Hello! My name is Ana. I am from Brazil. This is my friend, Paul. He is from the United States. She is Maria. She is a teacher. We are students at an English school. You are welcome to join us!

Our teachers are Mr. Smith and Ms. Jones. They are very nice. The school is big. It is near the park. We have class every day. Today, we are happy because it is Friday!

Paul is an engineer. He works with computers. Maria has a son. His name is Pedro. He is six years old. Pedro and I are friends. They are a happy family. Are you ready to learn?', '[{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"Maria é uma mulher (ela), então usamos o pronome ''she''.","options":["She","He","It","They"],"prompt":"Which pronoun can replace ''Maria''?"},{"answer_index":2,"explanation_pt_br":"Pedro and I = nós (we), e com ''we'' usamos ''are''.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"prompt":"Complete: ''Pedro and I ___ friends.''"},{"answer_index":1,"explanation_pt_br":"Com o pronome ''you'', o verbo ''be'' sempre é ''are''.","options":["You is ready.","You are ready.","You am ready.","You be ready."],"prompt":"Choose the correct sentence."}]'::jsonb, 0, true)
